{
  "declaredLength": 8356,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Disculpa, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa... ¿Me podrías hacer un\nfavorcito?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069007300630075006C00700061002C0020006D00750063006800610063006800100003110000FF0101006F0061002E002E002E002000BF004D006500200070006F0064007200ED0061007300200068006100630065007200200075006E000A006600610076006F0072006300690074006F003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría que le entregaras de mi parte una\ncarta a la directora de la Escuela Andrómeda.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo haría yo mismo, pero mis circunstancias me lo\nimpiden.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F002000680061007200ED006100200079006F0020006D00690073006D006F002C0020007000650072006F0020006D00690073002000630069007200630075006E007300740061006E00630069006100730020006D00650020006C006F000A0069006D0070006900640065006E002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices? ¿Le llevarás la carta?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006D0065002000640069006300650073003F002000BF004C00650020006C006C006500760061007200E100730020006C0061002000630061007200740061003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, sí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750065006E006F002C0020007300ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Por qué tanto misterio?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050006F007200200071007500E9002000740061006E0074006F0020006D006900730074006500720069006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tanto quieres saberlo, acepta mi encargo y\ndescubrirás de qué se trata.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias! Con solo verte, supe que ibas a tener\nla amabilidad de aceptar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toma, esta es la carta.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006D0061002C002000650073007400610020006500730020006C0061002000630061007200740061002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Asegúrate de entregársela en la mano a la\ndirectora de la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Escuela Andrómeda<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo te conozco...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSí, eres <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa que me ayudó a encontrar\nmi anillo. Te lo agradezco de corazón.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y bien, ¿qué te trae hoy a la Escuela Andrómeda?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006200690065006E002C002000BF0071007500E90020007400650020007400720061006500200068006F0079002000610020006C0061002000450073006300750065006C006100200041006E0064007200F3006D006500640061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy buscando a la directora",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F0079002000620075007300630061006E0064006F002000610020006C00610020006400690072006500630074006F007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tengo una carta para la directora",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E0067006F00200075006E0061002000630061007200740061002000700061007200610020006C00610020006400690072006500630074006F007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es tu día de suerte, porque yo soy la directora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730020007400750020006400ED00610020006400650020007300750065007200740065002C00200070006F007200710075006500200079006F00200073006F00790020006C00610020006400690072006500630074006F00720061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le entregaste la Carta Importante a Paulina.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200065006E007400720065006700610073007400650020006C006100200043006100720074006100200049006D0070006F007200740061006E00740065002000610020005000610075006C0069006E0061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿D-de dónde sacaste esta carta?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0044002D006400650020006400F3006E006400650020007300610063006100730074006500200065007300740061002000630061007200740061003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, espera. Antes que nada, debo comprobar\nuna cosa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006500730070006500720061002E00200041006E00740065007300200071007500650020006E006100640061002C0020006400650062006F00200063006F006D00700072006F006200610072000A0075006E006100200063006F00730061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías ir a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Construcciones Radix<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, por favor?\nEstá en el sector 6 del Distrito Verde.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por haber venido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000680061006200650072002000760065006E00690064006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por venir hasta aquí, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000760065006E00690072002000680061007300740061002000610071007500ED002C0020006D00750063006800610063006800100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tal vez debería haber venido a comprobarlo sola,\npero esta carta es tan extraña...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBueno, mejor te la leo, así terminamos con esto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "\"Querida mía, siento haberme ido de tu vida sin\npoder decirte esto en persona\".<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n\"Hace 14 años, le confié mi anillo a un hombre\npara que lo reparara\".<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n\"Se llama Estragón y es el propietario de\nConstrucciones Radix\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 225
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es imposible que me haya escrito mi difunto\nmarido... Por eso me dio tanto miedo venir sola.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Es usted Estragón?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073002000750073007400650064002000450073007400720061006700F3006E003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El mismo. ¿En qué puedo ayudarla?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020006D00690073006D006F002E002000BF0045006E00200071007500E900200070007500650064006F0020006100790075006400610072006C0061003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Disculpe, pero...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Recuerda que un hombre viniera hace 14 años\npara pedirle que reparara un anillo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como si fuera ayer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006F00200073006900200066007500650072006100200061007900650072002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aquel día fuimos a un restaurante a celebrar\nel cumpleaños de mi Naria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me puse a hablar con el hombre de la mesa de\nal lado. ¡Hasta a Naria le cayó bien!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando le conté cómo me gano la vida,\nme pidió que lo ayudara con una piedra<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque se le había salido de su anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me dijo que el anillo hacía juego con el de su\nesposa y que era muy importante para él.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aquel hombre era mi marido, pero poco después\ntuvo un accidente y...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007100750065006C00200068006F006D00620072006500200065007200610020006D00690020006D0061007200690064006F002C0020007000650072006F00200070006F0063006F00200064006500730070007500E90073000A007400750076006F00200075006E0020006100630063006900640065006E0074006500200079002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo siento mucho.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0020006D007500630068006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y qué la trae por aquí tantos años después,\nsi puedo preguntar?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005900200071007500E90020006C00610020007400720061006500200070006F0072002000610071007500ED002000740061006E0074006F00730020006100F1006F007300200064006500730070007500E90073002C000A0073006900200070007500650064006F002000700072006500670075006E007400610072003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es mi deber pagarle por la reparación del anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730020006D0069002000640065006200650072002000700061006700610072006C006500200070006F00720020006C006100200072006500700061007200610063006900F3006E002000640065006C00200061006E0069006C006C006F002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, señora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006600610076006F0072002C00200073006500F1006F00720061002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No puedo aceptar su dinero, pero a lo mejor...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nComo pago de la deuda, sí aceptaría un combate\ncontra <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te espero en el garaje, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa! Ven cuando\nestés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, siento tener que pedirte este\nfavor también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C0020007300690065006E0074006F002000740065006E0065007200200071007500650020007000650064006900720074006500200065007300740065000A006600610076006F0072002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además de las clases de repostería, Grisel me\nestá ayudando a mejorar mi técnica de combate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Quiero enseñarte lo que llevo aprendido!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Voy a ganar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006F007900200061002000670061006E0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no aceptas el combate, no podré devolverle\nel anillo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006E006F0020006100630065007000740061007300200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002C0020006E006F00200070006F0064007200E90020006400650076006F006C007600650072006C0065000A0065006C00200061006E0069006C006C006F002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora, ¡manos a la obra!\n¡Que comience el combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000610068006F00720061002C002000A1006D0061006E006F0073002000610020006C00610020006F0062007200610021000A00A100510075006500200063006F006D00690065006E0063006500200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
